        "notes": "Source-described preparation boundary retained under MAPPING_SEMANTICS section 3. No exact chemical or complete-formula equivalence is asserted. NBRC 1116, 1195, 1196 and 1200 and TOGO M2186, M2708 and M3181 explicitly use volume-dosed concentrated HCl reagent. This record denotes the qualitative source-described acid preparation, with variable or unspecified strength, not pure gaseous HCl or a certified commercial formulation. It preserves the source reagent boundary at UNDEFINED_MIXTURE granularity. NBRC 1200 prints 51.3 mL where NBRC 1195/1196 print 51.3 microlitres; these receiving-stock quantities remain unresolved and are not used to derive acid strength."
